\fs22
\b CorpServe API Endpoints Documentation\b0\par
Updated with latest implemented changes (UserPreference, Categories Admin, VendorVerify specs/includes, Reject Reason, Conflict errors, dynamic reset token lifespan).\par
Base URL: \i https://localhost:7170\i0  (or deployed host)\par
Base route pattern: \b api/[Controller]\b0\par
\par
\b Common Response Behavior\b0\par
- Success with data: HTTP 200 + JSON payload\par
- Success without data: HTTP 204\par
- Validation: HTTP 400\par
- Unauthorized: HTTP 401\par
- Forbidden: HTTP 403\par
- NotFound: HTTP 404\par
- Conflict: HTTP 409\par
- Failure: HTTP 500\par
\par
ProblemDetails sample:\par
{\f0
{
  "title": "Error.Code",\par
  "detail": "Error description",\par
  "type": "Validation|NotFound|Conflict|...",\par
  "status": 400/404/409/...\par
}
}\par
\par
\b 1) AuthenticationController\b0\par
Route prefix: \b api/Authentication\b0\par
\par
\b 1.1 POST /api/Authentication/register\b0\par
Auth: Anonymous\par
Request JSON:\par
{\f0
{
  "fullName": "string",\par
  "email": "string",\par
  "phone": "string",\par
  "password": "string",\par
  "confirmPassword": "string",\par
  "role": "Client|Vendor",\par
  "categoryIds": ["C-001","C-002"] // required when role = Vendor\par
}
}\par
Success: \b 200\b0 => {\f0 true }\par
Notes:\par
- Phone is validated in service.\par
- Phone DB constraint exceptions are handled and returned as validation errors.\par
\par
\b 1.2 POST /api/Authentication/login\b0\par
Auth: Anonymous\par
Request:\par
{\f0 { "email": "string", "password": "string" } }\par
Success \b 200\b0:\par
{\f0
{
  "fullName": "string",\par
  "email": "string",\par
  "token": "jwt",\par
  "role": "Admin|Vendor|Client"\par
}
}\par
\par
\b 1.3 POST /api/Authentication/forgot-password\b0\par
Auth: Anonymous\par
Request:\par
{\f0 { "email": "string" } }\par
Success: \b 200\b0 => {\f0 true }\par
Note: email body contains dynamic token lifespan from DataProtection options.\par
\par
\b 1.4 POST /api/Authentication/reset-password\b0\par
Auth: Anonymous\par
Request:\par
{\f0
{
  "email": "string",\par
  "token": "string",\par
  "newPassword": "string",\par
  "confirmNewPassword": "string"\par
}
}\par
Success: \b 200\b0 => {\f0 true }\par
\par
\b 2) UserProfileController\b0\par
Route prefix: \b api/UserProfile\b0\par
Auth: \b Required\b0\par
\par
\b 2.1 POST /api/UserProfile/update-user\b0\par
Request:\par
{\f0
{
  "fullName": "string?",\par
  "email": "string?",\par
  "phoneNumber": "string?"\par
}
}\par
Success: \b 200\b0 => {\f0 true }\par
Possible conflict: duplicate email -> HTTP 409.\par
\par
\b 2.2 POST /api/UserProfile/change-password\b0\par
Request:\par
{\f0
{
  "currentPassword": "string",\par
  "newPassword": "string",\par
  "confirmNewPassword": "string"\par
}
}\par
Success: \b 200\b0 => {\f0 true }\par
\par
\b 2.3 GET /api/UserProfile/user-preference\b0\par
Success \b 200\b0:\par
{\f0 { "emailNotification": true, "systemNotification": true } }\par
\par
\b 2.4 POST /api/UserProfile/update-user-preference\b0\par
Request:\par
{\f0 { "emailNotification": true, "systemNotification": false } }\par
Success: \b 200\b0 => {\f0 true }\par
\par
\b 3) CategoriesController\b0\par
Route prefix: \b api/Categories\b0\par
\par
\b 3.1 GET /api/Categories\b0\par
Auth: AllowAnonymous\par
Success \b 200\b0:\par
{\f0
[
  { "id": "C-001", "name": "Category Name" }
]
}\par
\par
\b 3.2 GET /api/Categories/admin\b0\par
Auth: Admin\par
Query params: `search`, `pageIndex`, `pageSize`\par
Success \b 200\b0:\par
{\f0
{
  "pageIndex": 1,\par
  "pageSize": 5,\par
  "count": 20,\par
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "C-001",\par
      "name": "Translation Services",\par
      "description": "...",\par
      "vendorCount": 4\par
    }
  ]\par
}
}\par
\par
\b 3.3 POST /api/Categories/admin/Create-Category\b0\par
Auth: Admin\par
Request:\par
{\f0 { "categoryName": "New Category", "description": "optional" } }\par
Success \b 200\b0 -> `CategoriesDTO`\par
Conflict when same name exists (409).\par
\par
\b 3.4 POST /api/Categories/admin/Update-Category/{categoryId}\b0\par
Auth: Admin\par
Request:\par
{\f0 { "categoryName": "Updated Name", "description": "optional" } }\par
Success: \b 200\b0 => {\f0 true }\par
\par
\b 3.5 DELETE /api/Categories/admin/Delete-Category/{categoryId}\b0\par
Auth: Admin\par
Success: \b 200\b0 => {\f0 true }\par
Conflict if category has vendors (409).\par
\par
\b 4) VendorVerifyController\b0\par
Route prefix: \b api/VendorVerify\b0\par
Auth: Vendor\par
\par
\b 4.1 POST /api/VendorVerify/submit\b0\par
Content-Type: multipart/form-data\par
Fields:\par
- organizationName: string\par
- documents: file[] (1..3)\par
Success \b 200\b0 -> `VendorVerifyDTO`\par
Conflict if vendor already has pending/approved request (409).\par
\par
\b 4.2 GET /api/VendorVerify/status\b0\par
Success \b 200\b0 -> `VendorVerifyDTO`\par
Important: certificates are included (fixed with specification include).\par
\par
\b 5) AdminVendorController\b0\par
Route prefix: \b api/AdminVendor\b0\par
Auth: Admin\par
\par
\b 5.1 GET /api/AdminVendor/pending\b0\par
Success \b 200\b0 -> `IEnumerable<VendorVerifyDTO>`\par
Important: certificates are included (fixed with specification include).\par
\par
\b 5.2 POST /api/AdminVendor/approve/{id}\b0\par
Success: \b 200\b0 => {\f0 true }\par
Effects:\par
- status = Approved\par
- reviewedAt set\par
- rejectReason cleared\par
- approval email sent\par
\par
\b 5.3 POST /api/AdminVendor/reject/{id}\b0\par
Request:\par
{\f0 { "rejectReason": "required, max 500" } }\par
Success: \b 200\b0 => {\f0 true }\par
Effects:\par
- status = Rejected\par
- reviewedAt set\par
- rejectReason saved\par
- rejection email sent with reason\par
\par
\b Shared DTO Shapes\b0\par
\b VendorVerifyDTO\b0:\par
{\f0
{
  "id": "V-001",\par
  "vendorId": "string",\par
  "vendorName": "string",\par
  "organizationName": "string",\par
  "submittedAt": "datetime",\par
  "status": 1,\par
  "reviewedAt": "datetime|null",\par
  "rejectReason": "string|null",\par
  "certificates": [
    {
      "id": 1,\par
      "fileUrl": "/uploads/vendor-certificates/file.pdf",\par
      "certificateType": "application/pdf",\par
      "uploadedAt": "datetime"\par
    }
  ]\par
}
}\par
\par
\b Notes\b0\par
- Protected endpoints require `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.\par
- Static files enabled, so certificate `fileUrl` paths are downloadable from API host.\par
}
